[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/5999297180","html_url":"https://github.com/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467#issuecomment-5999297180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","id":5999297180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAABZZYCnA","user":{"login":"alexar76","id":86793359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzkzMzU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86793359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76","html_url":"https://github.com/alexar76","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T17:08:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T17:08:19Z","body":"Agreed — on Base mainnet the USDC contract (0x8335…2913) answers `name() = \"USD Coin\"`, `version() = \"2\"`; \"USDC\" is Base Sepolia's name (0x036C…CF7e). A cheap guard against it coming back: build the domain separator from your table and compare it with the token's `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR()` in a test, per network. Disclosure: we run an offline checker for exactly this class of failure — give it the X-PAYMENT header (or authorization + signature + network) and it says whether USDC will accept the signature and, if not, which domain it was actually made for. Free via MCP (`x402_check` at https://modelmarket.dev/mcp) or $0.003 via x402 at https://modelmarket.dev/x402/x402-check.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/5999297180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6317099974","html_url":"https://github.com/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467#issuecomment-6317099974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","id":6317099974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAABeIdLxg","user":{"login":"crtahlin","id":1554520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/crtahlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T13:20:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:20:05Z","body":"Fix is up for review in #500 (targets `dev`, **not merged yet**).\n\n**What changes**\n- The `base` entry in `USDC_TOKEN_METADATA` now advertises `name: \"USD Coin\"` (version `\"2\"` unchanged). `base-sepolia` stays `\"USDC\"`, so staging behaves exactly as before.\n- The misleading comment (\"Circle uses USDC everywhere\") is replaced with one that says the name differs per network.\n- Three existing tests asserted the bug (both networks `\"USDC\"`, `\"USD Coin\"` forbidden). They are replaced by a test that computes each network's EIP-712 domain separator from the table (name, version, chainId, verifyingContract) and compares it with the recorded on-chain value, both directly and through the 402 requirements builder on `base`.\n- `docs/x402-client-integration.md` now notes that `extra.name` differs between networks and must be read from the 402.\n\nA repo-wide search found no other hardcoded mainnet domain name: the client samples sign with whatever `extra` contains.\n\n**How it was verified**\n- Read-only `eth_call` on the public Base RPCs, 2026-10-21:\n  - Base mainnet USDC: `name() = \"USD Coin\"`, `version() = \"2\"`, `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR = 0x02fa7265e7c5d81118673727957699e4d68f74cd74b7db77da710fe8a2c7834f`\n  - Base Sepolia USDC: `name() = \"USDC\"`, `version() = \"2\"`, `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR = 0x71f17a3b2ff373b803d70a5a07c046c1a2bc8e89c09ef722fcb047abe94c9818`\n- Mutation check: putting `\"USDC\"` back for `base` makes 3 tests fail (computed separator `0xe824be45ff…a3d7` vs on-chain `0x02fa72…834f`). Putting `\"USD Coin\"` on `base-sepolia` makes 2 fail. With the fix they pass.\n- Full test suite: 1653 passed, 25 skipped.\n\n**Follow-ups**\n- Must ship together with datafund/swarm_provenance_CLI#126 (same name on the client side).\n- Not built: the optional startup check against the chain on mainnet. `validate_x402_config()` is synchronous and offline today. Adding it means choosing what startup does when the RPC is unreachable, and `BASE_RPC_URL` is one setting that isn't tied to `X402_NETWORK`. The pinned test covers this regression. That check can be its own issue if it's still wanted.\n- Nothing has been tested against a live mainnet payment yet. That belongs to the mainnet cutover (#485).\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6317099974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6318769095","html_url":"https://github.com/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467#issuecomment-6318769095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","id":6318769095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAABeKDDxw","user":{"login":"crtahlin","id":1554520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/crtahlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T14:40:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:40:58Z","body":"Reopening: this was closed by the release PR datafund/swarm_provenance_CLI#162 because its description said \"the gateway fix datafund/swarm_connect#467\", which GitHub read as a closing keyword. The gateway fix (#500) is merged to `dev` but not yet to `main`, so it is not deployed to production. Per the board convention, this stays open until the gateway release.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6318769095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6339472787","html_url":"https://github.com/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467#issuecomment-6339472787","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","id":6339472787,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAABedytkw","user":{"login":"crtahlin","id":1554520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/crtahlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T11:19:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:19:45Z","body":"Fixed on `development` in #500. Closing as done; the fix reaches `main` with the next release.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6339472787/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/comments/6683684438","html_url":"https://github.com/da